  "title": "Famous Chicken Française",
  "description": "This Chicken Française recipe is made with seasoned, breaded chicken cutlets pan-fried until golden brown, then cooked in a fresh lemon butter sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Paula Tomlinson"
  ],
